# A published style plus the three values the rest of the template shares.
# Chromium was chosen by measurement: over Orderbooks' 70 C++ files it
# reproduced the tree with 1,087 changed lines against 1,488 for LLVM, 2,058
# for Google and 4,000 to 14,000 for Mozilla, WebKit, Microsoft and GNU, so it
# is the closest published description of how this code is written.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Chromium
Standard: c++20
ColumnLimit: 100
IndentWidth: 4
